  "managementDiscussion": "In fiscal year FY2026, HDFC Bank recorded revenue of \u20b93.70 lakh crore, growing 10.0% year-on-year, driven by continued momentum across Retail Banking, Corporate Banking. Net income stood at \u20b91.15 lakh crore with a net margin of 31.0% and a return on equity of 17.0%. Operating cash flow remained robust at \u20b91.22 lakh crore, supporting capital expenditure of \u20b90.03 lakh crore and a free cash flow of \u20b91.19 lakh crore. The company maintains a measured capital structure with net debt-to-equity of 1.85x. Management continues to invest in digital and AI capabilities, expects sustained volume-led growth and disciplined cost control, and remains committed to value-accretive capital allocation and sustainable returns for shareholders.",
